{
  "_comment": "DEMO CONFIGURATION, NOT A COMPARISON ARM. Arm C's file plus one hook: arrive.mjs, which hands the agent what the base holds about a coordinate it just touched. It was enabled in NO arm of any round, so no number on any RESULT page was produced under it. Built for the rehearsed moment in measurements/kb-arrival-2026-09/README.md: arriving at /company/members hands over KB-27B4CD10 unasked. Everything else is byte-identical to settings.arm-c.json -- verify with a diff, never with this sentence.",
